    "Anchor is the first zero-address deposit (nonce 86); BSC relayers executed every fake deposit from nonce 86 to 101, so the record's former anchor (nonce 92) is a campaign tx. BSC lending configuration (qXETH listing, collateral factor) predates the handler upgrade that sets the age.",
